ative Layout Shift.","fix":"Set width and height (or aspect-ratio) on images.","effort":"hours","msg":{"title":{"id":"pf-cls.title","vars":{"n":28}},"evidence":{"id":"pf-cls.evidence","vars":{}},"fix":{"id":"pf-cls.fix","vars":{}}}},{"area":"Analytics","verdict":"risk","severity":"medium","title":"CookieYes is present but Google Consent Mode defaults were not found","evidence":"No gtag consent default is written in the HTML, and the browser run saw no Google ping with Consent Mode denied. Without Consent Mode v2 defaults, Google tags can fire before the visitor chooses, and Google Ads loses modelled conversions.","fix":"Call gtag('consent','default',{ad_storage:'denied',analytics_storage:'denied',ad_user_data:'denied',ad_personalization:'denied'}) before the tags.","effort":"minutes","msg":{"title":{"id":"an-consent-mode.missing.title","vars":{"tools":{"items":["CookieYes"]}}},"evidence":{"id":"an-consent-mode.missing.evidence","vars":{"why":{"id":"an-consent-mode.missing.browsed","vars":{}}}},"fix":{"id":"an-consent-mode.missing.fix","vars":{}}}}],"works":[{"area":"SEO","title":"Every internal link that was opened answered","msg":{"title":{"id":"seo-broken-links.pass.title","vars":{}}}},{"area":"GEO","title":"AI answer and search crawlers may read the start page","msg":{"title":{"id":"geo-crawlers.pass.title","vars":{}}}},{"area":"Analytics","title":"3 measurement tools were found","msg":{"title":{"id":"an-inventory.title","vars":{"n":3}}}},{"area":"Security","title":"Front-end libraries have no known flaw","msg":{"title":{"id":"sec-libraries.pass.title","vars":{}}}},{"area":"Accessibility","title":"An accessibility statement is linked","msg":{"title":{"id":"a11y-statement.pass.title","vars":{}}}},{"area":"Performance","title":"The start page arrived in 148 ms","msg":{"title":{"id":"pf-home.pass.title","vars":{"ms":148}}}},{"area":"SEO","title":"Every page has a title","msg":{"title":{"id":"seo-title-missing.pass.title","vars":{}}}},{"area":"SEO","title":"Every pag